{"spread": 21, "blocks": [[{"t": "Speed sharpened her instincts at ISG ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 61, 213, 75]}, {"t": "and TCG. Huawei rollouts were the ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 73, 197, 87]}, {"t": "testing ground. \u201cYou win those jobs ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 85, 206, 99]}, {"t": "during procurement by involving the ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 97, 210, 111]}, {"t": "site team early. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 109, 108, 123]}], [{"t": "Things move faster when procurement ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 133, 220, 147]}, {"t": "is informed by how the work will really ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 145, 217, 159]}, {"t": "be done.\u201d The QA/QC lens never left ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 157, 204, 171]}, {"t": "either. \u201cQuality delivered on time is ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 169, 201, 183]}, {"t": "what leaves a mark. Get those two ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 181, 199, 195]}, {"t": "right and clients come back.\u201d She also ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 193, 218, 207]}, {"t": "rejects the myth that QS work is desk ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 205, 215, 219]}, {"t": "bound. \u201cMoney is on site.\u201d", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 217, 157, 231]}], [{"t": "Moving to Mint Building Services ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 241, 191, 255]}, {"t": "completed the loop. She had learned ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 253, 212, 267]}, {"t": "shell and core, then fit-out. What she ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 265, 213, 279]}, {"t": "wanted was the part that makes a ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 277, 199, 291]}, {"t": "building work. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 289, 101, 303]}], [{"t": "Building services turns a structure into ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 313, 222, 327]}, {"t": "a system of power, plant, and control. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 325, 215, 339]}, {"t": "It is also a different commercial seat. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 337, 211, 351]}], [{"t": "As a specialist, Mint must be nimble ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 361, 206, 375]}, {"t": "and exact, aligning design with means ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 373, 218, 387]}, {"t": "and methods while protecting margin.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [31, 385, 215, 399]}], [{"t": "Success now feels shared. Big ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 61, 392, 75]}, {"t": "contractors often measure by ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 73, 392, 87]}, {"t": "individual KPI. At Mint, small wins are ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 85, 421, 99]}, {"t": "noticed and celebrated. Repeatable ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 97, 420, 111]}, {"t": "delivery, tidy close-outs, and healthy ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 109, 427, 123]}, {"t": "cash are the markers.\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 121, 349, 135]}, {"t": "\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 133, 246, 147]}, {"t": "For Jaymee, cost management is how ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 145, 428, 159]}, {"t": "agility and quality become real. Deliver ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 157, 433, 171]}, {"t": "on time, with quality, within budget. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 169, 420, 183]}, {"t": "Give clients best value, not just the ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 181, 416, 195]}, {"t": "lowest line on a spreadsheet. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 193, 387, 207]}], [{"t": "She backs two habits that reduce risk: ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 217, 432, 231]}, {"t": "structured cost and time reviews at ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 229, 419, 243]}, {"t": "start, mid-point, and pre-close, and ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 241, 418, 255]}, {"t": "rigorous use of BIM and reliable supply ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 253, 433, 267]}, {"t": "chains to surface clashes early and ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 265, 418, 279]}, {"t": "lock lead times. Some commercial ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 277, 408, 291]}, {"t": "edges stay in the playbook, but ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 289, 400, 303]}, {"t": "early alignment on scope, temporary ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 301, 424, 315]}, {"t": "systems, and testing keeps disputes ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 313, 424, 327]}, {"t": "down.\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 325, 275, 339]}, {"t": "\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 337, 246, 351]}, {"t": "Outside work she resets with music, ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 349, 419, 363]}, {"t": "art, and books. Late-night cost plans ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 361, 425, 375]}, {"t": "run on coffee, black and hot. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 373, 384, 387]}], [{"t": "Favourite buildings: the Orchard Road ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 397, 428, 411]}, {"t": "malls for commercial complexity and ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 409, 423, 423]}, {"t": "the Fullerton Hotel for beauty. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [244, 421, 393, 435]}], [{"t": "Advice to her 22-year-old self: enjoy ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 61, 636, 75]}, {"t": "every moment and every opportunity. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 73, 642, 87]}], [{"t": "Asked about the move to Mint, she is ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 97, 637, 111]}, {"t": "already sure it was worth it. Looking ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 109, 633, 123]}, {"t": "ahead she sees a busy decade. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 121, 609, 135]}], [{"t": "\u201cConstruction in 2035 will be massive,\u201d ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 145, 645, 159]}, {"t": "she says. Revamps and regulatory ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 157, 623, 171]}, {"t": "updates will drive the work. The future ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 169, 644, 183]}, {"t": "belongs to those who think clearly, act ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 181, 647, 195]}, {"t": "early, and keep the numbers honest on ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 193, 647, 207]}, {"t": "site.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 205, 477, 219]}]]}